es you back much less, so a fully charged shot won't slide you into the sea anymore. [*] Fairer direct hits: direct hits no longer bounce the blast back toward the shooter or push the target into the ground. They now knock the target outward properly. [*] Capture the Flag","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-26T12:38:22Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114044773","verified_at":"2026-10-26T16:23:04Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5022650-1847286114041722","game_id":"steam-5022650","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update: Easier Mana Blocks, Rope Wall Kicks & Controller Fixes","summary":"This update makes building with Mana Blocks friendlier, adds a new rope technique and fixes several controller issues. I'd love to hear what you think! 🧱 Mana Block More forgiving placement: you can now place blocks on the steps and slopes at your feet, and blocks can sit up to halfway inside terrain Clear range preview: a translucent square shows where you can build. Cells you can't use are shown in red, and if a placement fails, the reason appears under your cursor. Placement range is now a sq","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-25T11:24:21Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114041722","verified_at":"2026-10-25T16:48:30Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5022650-1847286114040459","game_id":"steam-5022650","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update: Movement Polish Based on Your Feedback","summary":"Thank you all for trying the new movement and sending feedback! This update polishes it based on what you told me, plus a few quality-of-life improvements. 🏃 Movement Polish Steadier charged jumps: briefly leaving the ground on bumpy pixel terrain no longer cancels your charge. If you release in mid-air, the jump fires as soon as you land. Controller facing: when you let go of the right stick, your character now faces the direction you're moving, so you don't walk backwards or fire behind yourse","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-24T19:03:24Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114040459","verified_at":"2026-10-25T00:32:32Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5022650-1847286114037099","game_id":"steam-5022650","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update: Reworked Movement — I Need Your Feedback!","summary":"Many of you told me that moving around felt stiff, slippery and awkward, especially charged jumps. I heard you, so this update reworks how player movement feels. Please give it a try and let me know what you think! 🏃 Movement Rework Instant hop: press W / ↑ / Left Stick Up for a quick small hop that keeps your momentum. The jump button still does charged jumps. Move while charging: you can now walk while charging a jump. When you release, you jump in the direction you're holding, or toward your ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-23T16:19:58Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114037099","verified_at":"2026-10-23T20:56:08Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5022650-1847286114035460","game_id":"steam-5022650","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update: Easy AI, Visible Wind","summary":"🤖 AI Difficulty You can now choose the AI difficulty before a match: Standard or Easy Easy also works in the race modes: Rope Race, Jump Race and Broom Race A great way for new players to learn the ropes before taking on the full challenge 🌬️ Visible Wind Wind now draws white cartoon wind lines across the sky in the direction it's blowing Strong wind makes the lines curl into swirling bundles, so you can read the wind at a glance before taking your shot 🧹 Broom Race Bots now check whether they c","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-23T08:38:11Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114035460","verified_at":"2026-10-23T09:53:02Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5022650-1847286114032060","game_id":"steam-5022650","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update: Smoother Water, Fewer Stuck Moments","summary":"💧 Spell Water Water now settles and comes to rest instead of jittering in place Only real sideways currents can sweep you away Falling water gains speed, and water on flat ground flows at its original pace again Each shot releases a set amount of water. When the map holds too much, the oldest water evaporates first. 🔥❄️⚡ Elements Fire, Ice and Electric shots now carry the same amount of element as a normal shot Freezing water and melting ice now spread at most 1.5× the explosion radius 🧱 No More","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-22T10:21:52Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114032060","verified_at":"2026-10-22T12:25:12Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5022650-1847286114028383","game_id":"steam-5022650","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update: Tutorial Is Here!","summary":"🎓 New: Tutorial Open the SOLO page in the Play book to try the brand-new 11-step tutorial. It covers: Moving and charged jumps Firing, charged long shots and lobbing over walls Using the wind Blasting terrain, the Magic Rope and the Drill Building bridges and the instant shield It runs on real destructible terrain with guide cards, targets and off-screen arrows, and ends with a celebration screen and its own music. 🤖 Bot Tournament BOT TOURNAMENT now opens an intro window that explains how the t","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T10:37:04Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114028383","verified_at":"2026-10-21T14:35:28Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5022650-1846651706695840","game_id":"steam-5022650","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update: Online Multiplayer Fixes & Quality of Life","summary":"Thank you to everyone who played the Mana Boom demo and sent us feedback! This update focuses on online play, based directly on your reports. Online Multiplayer Fixed a bug where some players couldn't cast any spells for the whole session (ammo and cooldown were used, but nothing came out). This also caused their shots to pass through other players, and stopped them from seeing other players' ropes and explosions. Fixed non-host players falling through the water in Jump Race and getting stuck fo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T16:00:45Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706695840","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:39:31Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5022650-1846651706693807","game_id":"steam-5022650","kind":"update","title":"Hotfix – Multiplayer Lobby Fixes 🔧","summary":"Thanks to everyone who's tried the Mana Boom demo so far!I've just released an update addressing issues with multiplayer lobbies, including:Public lobbies not appearing in the lobby browserPlayers being unable to join their friends' lobbiesThese issues should now be resolved!If you experienced connection problems earlier, please update the demo and give it another try.If you're still having trouble, or encounter any other bugs, please let me know in the Discussions!Thanks for your patience and f","occurred